# This build context is intentionally minimal: the derived Jenkins image
# (infra/jenkins/Dockerfile) copies tools from builder images and downloads
# pinned binaries; it uses no local files. Without this, `docker build .` from
# the repo root would stream the whole .runtime tree (JENKINS_HOME copies and
# the Colima datadisk) into the context and fail.
*
!infra/jenkins/Dockerfile
